@node gpui-au Manual
@chapter Crate @code{gpui-au}
@cindex gpui-au
@cindex Audio Unit

@code{gpui-au} is the macOS Audio Unit platform backend for GPUI. It
embeds GPUI rendering inside an AUv3 @code{AUViewController} so SotF
plugins can present a native GPUI editor when loaded by Logic Pro,
GarageBand, MainStage or any AUv3 host.

